  "extract": "The Battle of Hattin took place on 4 July 1187, between the Crusader states of the Levant and the forces of the Ayyubid Sultanate of Egypt, led by Sultan Saladin. It is also known as the Battle of the Horns of Hattin, due to the shape of the nearby extinct volcano of that name.",
  "extract_html": "<p>The <b>Battle of Hattin</b> took place on 4 July 1187, between the Crusader states of the Levant and the forces of the Ayyubid Sultanate of Egypt, led by Sultan Saladin. It is also known as the <b>Battle of the Horns of Hattin</b>, due to the shape of the nearby extinct volcano of that name.</p>"
